  "description": "Retrieve email from server by POP3/IMAP4/EWS/Graph API/Gmail Rest API protocols and parse email in C#, VB, ASP.NET, Managed C++ or other .NET environment applications. SSL/TLS, S/MIME, Gmail OAUTH are supported.",
